WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.916
In about two minutes, you will set up a contest your way, with judges and a prize.

00:00:05.818 --> 00:00:09.104
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:11.065 --> 00:00:13.497
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:13.497 --> 00:00:15.996
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:15.996 --> 00:00:17.346
Tap Use my location.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:21.478
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:21.478 --> 00:00:22.175
Tap Allow.

00:00:25.676 --> 00:00:28.042
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:28.042 --> 00:00:29.196
See the three dots?

00:00:29.196 --> 00:00:29.716
Tap them.

00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:33.465
In the menu, tap Add.

00:00:35.231 --> 00:00:36.438
Three choices.

00:00:36.438 --> 00:00:37.565
Tap A contest.

00:00:39.402 --> 00:00:40.692
Name your contest.

00:00:40.692 --> 00:00:42.525
Type a name, then tap Next.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:46.616
Who is running it?

00:00:46.616 --> 00:00:49.310
Type the name, pick your city, then tap Next.

00:00:52.401 --> 00:00:55.007
This welcome message is already written.

00:00:55.007 --> 00:00:56.406
Keep it, and tap Next.

00:00:58.210 --> 00:00:59.854
A website is optional.

00:00:59.854 --> 00:01:01.426
Skip it, and tap Next.

00:01:03.402 --> 00:01:05.526
These dates are filled in for you.

00:01:05.526 --> 00:01:06.072
Tap Next.

00:01:08.197 --> 00:01:10.233
Choose Customize everything.

00:01:10.233 --> 00:01:11.216
Then tap Next.

00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:15.506
Add your own category.

00:01:15.506 --> 00:01:16.538
Then tap Next.

00:01:19.972 --> 00:01:20.994
Who can vote?

00:01:20.994 --> 00:01:23.257
We choose Everyone and judges.

00:01:23.257 --> 00:01:24.279
Then tap Next.

00:01:26.815 --> 00:01:29.887
Add your judges, one email on each line.

00:01:29.887 --> 00:01:30.936
Then tap Next.

00:01:33.733 --> 00:01:34.842
Choose score.

00:01:34.842 --> 00:01:35.951
Then tap Next.

00:01:38.498 --> 00:01:39.814
Keep the default.

00:01:39.814 --> 00:01:40.472
Tap Next.

00:01:42.641 --> 00:01:43.957
Keep the default.

00:01:43.957 --> 00:01:44.615
Tap Next.

00:01:46.771 --> 00:01:48.087
Keep the default.

00:01:48.087 --> 00:01:48.744
Tap Next.

00:01:50.928 --> 00:01:51.812
Add a prize.

00:01:51.812 --> 00:01:54.122
We give each winner the same one.

00:01:54.122 --> 00:01:55.073
Then tap Next.

00:01:58.864 --> 00:02:00.494
Your rules are written.

00:02:00.494 --> 00:02:01.105
Tap Next.

00:02:03.269 --> 00:02:06.067
Check everything, and tap Create contest.

00:02:08.496 --> 00:02:10.127
Your contest is live!

00:02:10.127 --> 00:02:11.758
Tap Open my dashboard.

00:02:13.703 --> 00:02:18.103
This is your dashboard, with your link and QR code, ready to share.

00:02:19.308 --> 00:02:21.572
Next up: Share your contest.
